window.products.push({"id":930066,"name":"William Bounds Rook Pepper Mill and Salt Shaker Set - Brushed Metal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yAW2AlCtL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Product Description The William Bounds Rook Mill & Shaker Set with refill tubes is the perfect boxed gift for any occasion. Featuring a brushed metallic finish, the pepper mill and salt shaker set is an appealing compact addition to smaller kitchens and dining tables. The pepper mill’s knob allows full adjustability; simply twist right for coarse and left for fine. The exclusive William Bounds stainless and ceramic milling mechanism, with no interlocking parts, prevents the Rook Mill from jamming or wearing out. Designed to crush rather than grind ingredients in both directions, our milling mechanism maximizes flavor with minimal effort. There are many imitations, but don’t be deceived. The William Bounds, Ltd. Mill collections all started with a simple concept. Organic design with a modern twist. Friendly to the hand, pleasing to the eye and complementing traditional and modern tables alike. Since 1965, when William Bounds started the company, we have proudly manufactured quality products in the United States. Each salt and pepper mill we manufacture is produced and assembled with the same care and attention to detail that Mr. Bounds brought to our products way back in 1965. We strive to create mills that work as beautifully as they look. Made from the finest materials. The Rook Mill is made to last a lifetime, and we stand behind it with a lifetime warranty. If the mechanism ever malfunctions, or you find a manufacturing fault, we will replace it. Amazon.com William Bounds, Ltd. has spent more than 40 years making mills and shakers for pepper and salt from the simple and casual, to the highly decorated. The diminutive stainless steel Rook pepper mill and salt shaker set falls somewhere in the middle. Named after the rook chess piece, they stand 4 inches tall and sport a soft, brushed-steel finish that produces a modern bistro look. Stainless steel construction and their portable size make them ideal for picnics or camping. The pepper mill crushes peppercorns using a steel-and-ceramic mechanism patented by William Bounds. Crushing rather than grinding ensures better flavor and more consistent size. The grind is adjusted turning the small top knob marked with the letter \"P\"--clockwise for coarse and counterclockwise for a finer grind. The salt shaker has a small white toggle that opens and closes the shaker holes. As long as the holes are closed when not in use, moisture cannot get in and cause salt to clump. The Rook salt shaker and pepper mill stand 4 inches tall and 1-3/4 inches across at their widest point. They come with an order form for sea salt and peppercorns. William Bounds offers a lifetime warranty for its products. --Garland Withers From the Manufacturer The William Bounds patented milling mechanisms crush rather than grind the peppercorns, resulting in milled pepper with a fresh flavor and consistent texture. In addition, the company's saltshakers have unique tops with closable holes to better withstand humid conditions. This Rook mill/shaker set is made of brushed stainless steel and has an elegant yet modern appearance. With the combination of William Bounds' three-step adjusting ring, unique milling mechanism, high-quality materials, and exacting production standards, the company's products are truly in a class of their own. All William Bounds mills and shakers feature a lifetime warranty on materials and workmanship. See more","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yAW2AlCtL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"William Bounds","source_asin":"B00008DHQF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-930066","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00008DHQF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00008DHQF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
