window.products.push({"id":930089,"name":"Replacement for Lg Window Air Conditioner Remote Control AKB73016003 for LW6013ER","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61v00uVKrrL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","description":"1. Replacement for LG Window air conditioner remote control model number: AKB73016003It works for: LW6013ER 2. This replacement has LG basic functions: POWER/ TEMP/ FAN SPEED/ TIMER/ MODE/ ENERGY SAVER/ AUTO SWING(Optional).The optional function is only available when your air conditioner has this function. 3. NO battery inclueded. 4. This is not a universal LG remote control, please check your model number must be \"AKB73016003“ before place order.If you are not sure about which remote to order for your unit, please just contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61v00uVKrrL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B074LQ3S1F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-930089","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074LQ3S1F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074LQ3S1F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
