window.products.push({"id":930330,"name":"Norpro Stainless Steel Scoop, 50MM (3 Tablespoons), Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ISRvi7UxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Measures: 8.5\" x 2.25\" x 1\" / 21.5cm x 5.5cm x 2.5cmScoop: 3 Tbsp/1.5oz/45ml/50mm, approximately 24 scoops per quart.Heavy-duty spring action releases food easily. Ideal for scooping ice cream, scoop and drop cookie dough, use to make meatballs, to make fruit/melon balls and also great for dishing up pet food. Made of stainless steel with a high polished finish. Hand washing recommended. Norpro was founded in 1973 with a vision to design, manufacture, and supply the highest caliber kitchenware. Norpro’s offering of innovative, high quality product for cooking, preparing and serving food are produced with superior materials and craftsmanship. Amazon.com An all-purpose scoop, this tool portions ice cream, frozen yogurt, cookie dough, meat balls, rice dishes, and vegetable purées. And it's ideal for forming pretty sherbet balls to fill dessert glasses. Its heavy-duty spring action releases food with a squeeze of the hand by sliding a thin steel band beneath it. The scoop head holds 3 tablespoons. The tool measures 8-1/2 inches overall, is made of noncorrosive 18/8 stainless steel polished to a mirror finish, and is dishwasher-safe. --Fred Brack Brand Story By Norpro See more","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ISRvi7UxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Norpro","source_asin":"B00G0NR162","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-930330","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00G0NR162","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00G0NR162","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
