window.products.push({"id":930337,"name":"Travel Electric Kettle, Portable Electric Kettle for Boiling Water, Small Travel Tea Kettle Automatic Shut off, One Cup Hot Water Maker, 350ml-Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518ZXeu2H0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Conyee portable water kettle for Boiling Water - Automatic Shut off -350ml /Stainless Steel -- Make single serving oatmeal, coffee or tea. No Leak Conyee travel water kettle has a great seal so it won’t leak even upside down turn, carry liquids so easy in your bag! Boil Fast Brought the water go up to 100 degrees under 5 minutes!! Hand Held Size This portable lightweight electric kettle is good for you to carry around while travelling to help you saving spaces and make your travel more convenient and less burden. Packing List: 1 x Portable kettle 1 x Removable power cord 1 x User manual  Conyee portable water boile is must have for frequent travelers. It’s a small travel-size portable tea kettle that you can use to brew coffee, tea, herbs, or to heat food. Hotel You can enjoy a warm tea in the privacy of your hotel room after an intense business day. Office A cup of hot water, coffee, tea every weekday morning ! Every community place You will love being able to make hot water with your personal electric kettle ! IMPORTANT NOTICE: It’s about the size of a coffee grinder or thermos bottle(350ml/12oz). It is only suitable for use by one or two people. DO The air hole must be opened when boiling water. Wait for 2 minutes after switching it off, as boiling water may come out under pressure. Unplug it after the water is boiling, or it will continue to re-heat once it drops below a certain temperature. Boiling water with LEMON will easily remove limescale. Boiling water with TEA will minimize any metallic taste. DO NOT X Don't Use the vent for pouring water. X Don't Connect to 220V supply unless transformer is available. X Don't Use at altitudes above 1000 meters, will not burn or automatically shut off.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518ZXeu2H0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Conyee","source_asin":"B0B4CGJGCK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-930337","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4CGJGCK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4CGJGCK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
