window.products.push({"id":930481,"name":"Perfect Pearl Water Resistant Clock, Quiet Non-Ticking Sweep Movement, 6.5\" in Diameter, Plastic Frame, Flexible Options to Hang or to Stand. (Dark Gr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lYkYZ5EEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Perfect Shell Dark Green Pearl Clock comes with two black hands and one red sweep hand. It has a circular access on the back so the clock can be hung as many other regular wall clocks. However, in addition to this conventional placement option, a stand comes with this clock that the clock can be placed upright anywhere you desire with ease. The best feature of the clock is that it is water resistant, so you can put it in bathroom, kitchen, or anywhere that water might present! This clock is not only a perfect time keeper, but also a piece of art work! It will for sure bring extra aesthetic aura to your place no matter where you decide to put it!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lYkYZ5EEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WazStone","source_asin":"B08FBQPF5C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-930481","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FBQPF5C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FBQPF5C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":930482,"name":"White Iris Artwork by Rita Auerbach, 22 x 32\" Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FeuoTRaHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features watercolor flowers. Rita Auerbach is inspired by the way light transforms the world around her, whether it is architecture, landscape, or still life. Light, so much a part of nature, creates endless possibilities and presents her with the freedom to express and interpret that beauty in her paintings. She works primarily in watercolor, an elusive and challenging medium. In spite of its technical demands, she manipulates shape, form, texture, value, and color to make a strong personal statement, resulting in bountiful, luminous effects using transparent paint. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FeuoTRaHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B011O9TA9C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-930482","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B011O9TA9C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B011O9TA9C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
