window.products.push({"id":930492,"name":"HAUS AND HUES Minimalist Wall Art Abstract Poster - Minimalist Line Art Drawing Poster, Sketch Minimalist Women Wall Decor, Black and White Prints Wal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cWUgdXC-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CELEBRATE LOVE: You will fall in love with Haus and Hues’s lovely hand holding line art, which features a couple hands holding each other in black and white. This is the perfect pick for those who want to surprise their spouse or partner. Sparks will fly once you hang this minimal hand wall art in your bedroom or living room as your space will be reminded of good memories you had with your loved ones PERFECT FOR COUPLES & LOVERS: Our black and white couples wall art will help you create the decorating vignettes you've been wanting to do for a long time. Make this line art wall decor a focal point, add some beautiful photos of you and your partner, and then complete it with other bedroom wall art decor. Or, include this minimalist art in your family gallery wall and notice how your space feels more like home GREAT QUALITY & PACKAGING: Haus & Hues supports the art community worldwide. We only use Giclée printing which is far superior to all other printing forms because it holds its colors far longer than any standard prints. Each art print is printed on acid-free and fade-resistant fine archival linen paper. Our 12” x 16” minimalist posters are packaged with chipboard pads to protect against creases and dents and shipped in Kraft self-seal stay flats to preserve your artwork while in transit ORDER CONFIDENTLY, EXPECT HIGH QUALITY: We have absolute faith in the quality of our wall art. Our team has carefully checked all art prints in the famous Wynwood Arts District in Miami, Florida, before leaving our workshop to maintain quality assurance. If there’s any problem with your order, simply contact us, and we will refund you or offer you a replacement. With us, you always shop stress and risk-free. So, either you'll love your new minimalist wall decor, or it's free A ROMANTIC GIFT: Surprise your husband, wife, boyfriend, or girlfriend on your special day by giving this loving bedroom wall decor. Just know it'll produce sweet smiles after your loved ones open this gift. It is the best gift for anniversaries, weddings, birthdays, Mother's Day, Valentine’s Day, and other occasions. Any couple will be thrilled to receive this minimalistic bedroom art print and hang it over their bedroom walls or office walls","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cWUgdXC-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HAUS AND HUES","source_asin":"B08ZJRZ6HL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-930492","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZJRZ6HL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZJRZ6HL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
