window.products.push({"id":930734,"name":"MEYDLL Portable Electric Space Heater, 1500W Ceramic Heater with 12h Timer, 3 Modes Heat Up 200 Square Feet in Minutes, Safety Quiet Heating, Small He","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SAKOMtOdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THREE WIND SPEEDS SWITCHING：The advanced PTC ceraming heating technology combined with the ultra-efficient fan will heat up any space faster and distribute the heat more evenly.We have three wind speeds switching: natural air, low heat, high heat. This ceramic heater is designed to offer you a maximum comfort in any way you look at it. ANTI-TILTING DESIGN:We have ensured the safety of you and your loved ones by adding an advanced overheat protection sensor as well as a smart tip-over switch, which will automatically turn off the heater in case it overheats or gets tipped over by your kids or pets.Cold to touch, reinforced prongs and V0 flame retardant materials makes this fan heater a must have in each household. QUIET&LOW NOISE: Forget those noisy heater fans that stop you from getting a good night's sleep. Our portable electric heater has a DC motor and a 9-blade fan, what makes it extremely quiet. Energy-efficient is quieter than traditional ones, works with a noise level down to 40dB and cover more areas. With 3 heating modes & fan mode, this ceramic heater is designed to offer you a maximum comfort in any way you look at it. 70° WIDESPREAD OSCILLATION:Nothing is worse than a central heater that isn't up to scratch on a dark, cold night. With a unique design, a 70° oscillating, an adjustable digital thermostat, LED display and touch control, providing a targeted warmth and zero complications when customizing the ambient temperature.Just touch the key to the desired heat setting and let the thermostat monitor the surrounding air temperature and keep you comfy. PERFECT FOR YOUR HOME OR OFFICE：The compact and portable design combined with the ergonomic built-in handle, will allow you to easily move your space heater to any room you want. Make sure your office, kitchen, bedroom, guest room, study or living room is nice and warm.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SAKOMtOdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MEYDLL","source_asin":"B0BFW2MFN9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-930734","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFW2MFN9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFW2MFN9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":930735,"name":"1000 Thread Count Egyptian Cotton Bed Sheets, King Sheet Set, Single Ply Long-Staple Yarns, Sateen Weave, Fits Mattress Upto 18'' Deep Pocket, 1 Fitte","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":132.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41+OVG24jFL._AC_.jpg","description":"Cotton PREMIUM QUALITY EGYPTIAN COTTON SHEET SET: Add a touch of luxury to your bedroom with 1000 thread count Egyptian Cotton Sheet Set from Trivian Life. The 4-piece sheet set consists of a flat sheet 108” x 102”; a fitted sheet 78” x 80” with 15” deep pocket and all-around elastic to fit a mattress up to 9” to 18”; and two standard pillowcases 40” x 20”. Made from 100% long staple Egyptian cotton & sateen weave, our sheet set delivers 5-star hotel experience so you wake up feeling fresh every day. SOFT, BREATHABLE & COMFORTABLE: Our 1000 TC Egyptian cotton sheets are soft, breathable, and comfortable for long-lasting usage. Made from pure long-staple cotton weave, our 1000 thread count King-size bed sheets keep you cool in summers and warm in winters. Expertly woven for top performance, our cotton bed sheets are thick and heavy, similar to 5-star hotel sheets for a cozy and comfortable experience. EASY TO CARE & MACHINE WASHABLE: Our luxury bed linens are machine washable and wrinkle-resistant for hassle-free maintenance. Simply toss them in cold water and tumble dry on low mode. The superior fabric is fade-resistant, shrink-resistant, and stain-resistant to meet performance standards. Our Egyptian sheets are more durable than cotton sheets and tend to get softer after every wash. CERTIFIED, SUSTAINABLE & ECO-FRIENDLY: Our sheets are made in a certified facility to ensure the highest safety and quality. Every inch of fabric is tested for no pilling, low shrinkage, color fastness, strength, and thread count authenticity. No harmful chemicals are used to ensure a comfortable sleeping experience. You can rest well knowing your sheets are sustainable, eco-friendly, and soothing to even the most sensitive skin, for ultimate night’s sleep. 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: We’re confident that you’ll love our 1000 TC Egyptian cotton sheets set. The luxury sheets complement any space such as guest room, kid’s room, vacation home, RV, etc. Not just that, our high thread count sheet sets are an ultimate gift on Valentine’s day, Mother’s day, Father’s day, Christmas, Thanksgiving, and New Year’s Eve. However, even then, if you are not satisfied with our sheets, you can write to us and we will resolve your issue at the earliest.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41+OVG24jFL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trivian Life","source_asin":"B07YC99KHR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-930735","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YC99KHR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YC99KHR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
