window.products.push({"id":930885,"name":"Weighted Blanket(25lbs,88x104\",King Size)Big large giant Heavy Blanket for Adult Couples Women Men,Warm Soft Flannel and Cooling Fabric Double-Sided W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rh7gFRohL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【SAVE YOUR MONEY】: The traditional weighted blanket is small and can only be used by one person. L'AGRATY weighted blanket is large and can be used by a family at the same time. If you use traditional weighted blankets, you need to buy two or even three to meet the needs of a family. Now you only need to buy one L'AGRATY oversized weighted blanket to meet the needs of the whole family, and the price of L'AGRATY weighted blanket is much lower than the price of three traditional weighted blankets. 【GOOD QUALITY】: L'AGRATY weighted blanket is made by a factory certified by OEKO-TEX STANDARD 100. The weighted blanket is made of soft, breathable fabric and 0.8-1mm non-toxic, non-allergenic glass beads. Moreover, we use high-strength sewing thread, which is very strong to ensure that the beads will not enter another area from one area during use of blanket. 【FOUR SEASONS USE】: L'AGRATY weighted blanket uses different fabrics on both sides, one side is Flannel, the other side is Cooling fabric. In summer, puting cooling fabrics side on your skin can speed up heat dissipation and make you feel cooler when you sleep. It is an ideal choice for hot sleepers. In winter, use the side of the flannel on your skin to keep warm. 【WEIGHT & SIZE】: We recommend that you choose a weight of about 6%-10% of your body weight. 80\"x87\" and 88\"x104\" are suitable for Queen size bed，King Size bed. Weighted Blanket is much smaller than ordinary blanket, because it is supposed to concentrate the weight on human body so the weighted blanket would not hang over the edge of your bed. Please don't mistake it as incorrect size when you get it 【EASY CARE】: Since the size of the weighted blanket is too large and the weight is too heavy, we do not recommend machine washing. Hand washing and hanging to dry is the best way to clean. It can also be dried at low temperature. Do not bleach, do not iron.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rh7gFRohL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"L'AGRATY","source_asin":"B09BC5SGHK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-930885","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BC5SGHK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BC5SGHK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":930886,"name":"Kootek 32-Piece Piping Bags and Tips Set with 24 Icing Piping Tips, 2 Reusable Pastry Bags 12 Inch, Reusable Piping Icing Bags and Tips, Cake Decorati","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Nr6xHfYML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Essential Cake Decorating Kit: 24 numbered & easy to use stainless steel piping tips, 2 reusable piping bags, 3 shapes of cake scraper, 2 reusable converters, 1 flower nail, 1 storage box that keeps everything organized. With just a few key baking tools, you'll be able to make cake decorating a piece of cake. Piping Bags and Tips Set: 24 numbered piping tips offer various of patterns, including Closed Star, Opened Star, Round, Basketweave, Leaf, Petal, and Specialty tips. Additionally, 2 couplers allow you to easily switch between tips without having to refill the bag. This also makes the piping set more eco-friendly than disposable piping bags. Moreover, 2 reusable piping bags with smooth interior design allows for easy cleanup, while the non-slip exterior provides a comfortable and easy grip. Cake Scrapers for a Professional Finish: If you want the edges of your cake to have patterns, lines, or clean edges, use the included flat, round, or serrated tooth-shaped scrapers, which give your icing or frosting a smooth or textured look. Whether you're a beginner or an experienced baker, these tools are must-haves for achieving a professional finish. Convenient storage: The baking supplies come with a handy storage box that keeps all of the included accessories organized and within reach when you need them. This ensures that you won't have to waste time searching for the right tool when you're in the middle of a decorating project. Perfect Gift for Different Occasion: The cake decorating supplies kit is a versatile and thoughtful gift for birthdays, weddings, Mother's Day, Christmas, Easter, housewarming, or anniversaries. With these baking accessories, you can create professional-looking cupcakes, cakes, bread, biscuits, and other desserts for different occasion. Create beautiful and inviting desserts that will impress your guests at many event.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Nr6xHfYML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kootek","source_asin":"B01BV4E68U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-930886","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01BV4E68U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01BV4E68U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
