window.products.push({"id":930996,"name":"Howard Miller Christina Gold Anniversary Table Clock 645-690 - Polished Brass Finish, 9 Inch Dome, Pendulum Includes 4 Revolving Crystals, Quartz Move","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71q3uk5wWTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"TABLE CLOCK: The Christina Table Clock features a 9 inch glass dome with a metal and brass finished plastic base, and triple crown finial to compliment your decor. The pendulum includes four beautiful revolving synthetic crystals. The clock’s movement makes a soft ticking noise without the use of chimes for a quieter environment. DURABLE: This indoor modern clock is created to last. It has a sturdy frame to relieve stress in a busy household. Display it in your kitchen, office, bathroom, bedroom, living room, and more. HIGH QUALITY: This classic design is a home essential. Easily tell time with circular spun silver, numeral ring with embossed center design, black Roman numerals, open fret cut diamond hands, and a brass-tone bezel to stand out over a two-tone satin brass-finished dial. DIMENSIONS: The height of this clock is 9 inches (23 cm) with a diameter of 6 inches (15 cm). It is powered by quartz movement, and includes three AA sized batteries. The traditional Roman numerals feature IIII instead of IV. HOWARD MILLER: Founded in 1926 and still family-owned in its third generation, Howard Miller is the world’s leading clock company and a respected brand name in fine specialty furnishings such as curio cabinets, wine and bar furnishings, custom storage cabinets, and SmartMoves adjustable height desks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71q3uk5wWTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Howard Miller","source_asin":"B0034PNJTM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-930996","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0034PNJTM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0034PNJTM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
